    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "What would be the best evidence that I fell into a shame spiral last night and ate half a gallon of Ben & Jerry’s ice cream in the dark in my underwear",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Je crie, tu cries, nous crions tous parce que l'existence est une douleur ",
